abstract: >-
  Constant product automated market maker built end to end: Solidity pair,
  factory, router and sliding window TWAP oracle with flash swaps, EIP-2612
  permit and fee-on-transfer support; a Node and TypeScript event indexer with
  block-hash reorganisation detection and rollback; and a Next.js, React and
  wagmi interface presenting the swap flow as an explicit state machine.
